{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18298","headline":"海水 · 韩愈","name":"海水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海水非不广，邓林岂无枝。\n风波一荡薄，鱼鸟不可依。\n海水饶大波，邓林多惊风。\n岂无鱼与鸟，巨细各不同。\n海有吞舟鲸，邓有垂天鹏。\n苟非鳞羽大，荡薄不可能。\n我鳞不盈寸，我羽不盈尺。\n一木有余阴，一泉有余泽。\n我将辞海水，濯鳞清冷池。\n我将辞邓林，刷羽蒙笼枝。\n海水非爱广，邓林非爱枝。\n风波亦常事，鳞鱼自不宜。\n我鳞日已大，我羽日已修。\n风波无所苦，还作鲸鹏游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18298.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18298","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}